{"summary":"Classic arcade racer, now with a road trip across Japan","description":"Pure arcade racing at full throttle!\n\nFinal Freeway is a classic arcade racer built for speed, flow and clean handling. Beat the clock to every checkpoint, weave through traffic and chase the horizon across America, Europe, Africa and now Japan.\n\nNEW: THE JAPAN TOUR\nDrive the length of Japan in seven new stages: from the beaches of Okinawa, through the Kumamoto uplands, Kobe harbour, old Kyoto, Hakone beneath Mount Fuji and Tokyo at twilight, to the plains of Hokkaido.\n\nFEATURES:\n- Three ways to race: Course Run, Road Splits and Time Attack\n- Course Run: three full courses, including the new Japan Tour\n- Road Splits: pick left or right at every fork, across eight routes with four different endings\n- Time Attack: sprint any classic stage for the best lap time\n- Reach each checkpoint to extend your time\n- Three cars and three difficulty settings\n- Tilt, slide or touch steering, plus game controller support\n- A strong sense of speed with smooth, responsive handling\n- An original soundtrack, with three tracks to choose from\n- Optional CRT screen filter for an arcade-cabinet look\n\nJump in for a quick run or chase the perfect route for a new high score.","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/BX8w9w-Tavk?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3UO0WUIrwFyvA38hPBzcStKnpz3qfIRFqEEfxTx46W-LNAIBWh-HrnFTLeAWTgVcRKe2Bzcz7bd71KNaWV6h7w","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DYu9rXkz9xO08B9d7UO2_ioyaeSt_KivJFrnUq-ibkSVVGsApSOeIZdvaecpwg1jGrQ_KnWZPCuZlKW4ZfgfDg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/31qSKvcj-YYmxBy1P2B4FRfNYs7jUnxHaQw3UhSL8V6xKHpOaWW_nXrXGpQQiBuGSBmSlFRmFzXPipflXC4XSBY","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xd2kaLFyVAm3M2AxheoAoMth42iXojAISy3zJ590ZChHSJrt2VMtVlDSnHYqBNJS3ztzwwY30WYi2jEUjZa9vA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BVi0OR5wfdl6ZcrbFH